OL,3,AProcession to move King Harald V's
OL,4,Acoffin to Oslo's Royal Palace begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Harald V's coffin is being moved
OL,7,Ffrom Norway's national hospital to the
OL,8,FRoyal Palace in Oslo - crowds are
OL,9,Fgathering along the route
OL,11,FHarald, who was on the throne for 35
OL,12,Fyears, died early on Friday at age 89
OL,14,FKing Haakon VIII has now taken the
OL,15,Fthrone following the death of his
OL,16,Ffather. He has opted to keep the
OL,17,Ffamily's long-standing royal motto:
OL,18,F"All for Norway"
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
