OL,3,AProcession to move King Harald V's
OL,4,Acoffin to Oslo's Royal Palace begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Norwegian PM says "a whole nation
OL,7,Fis in mourning" following his death -
OL,8,FOslo's mayor says she has cancelled her
OL,9,Fwedding, which was scheduled for today
OL,11,FThe late king was a popular leader and
OL,12,Fis credited with modernising the
OL,13,FNorwegian monarchy - he broke with
OL,14,Ftradition by marrying a commoner, Queen
OL,15,FSonja
OL,17,FFlowers are being laid at a memorial
OL,18,Fnear the palace, and the UK's King
OL,19,FCharles III shares his "most heartfelt
OL,20,Fcondolences"
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
